Improper Input Validation and Command Injection The application accepts user-uploaded video files and frame numbers without explicit validation, which could lead to command injection vulnerabilities when constructing the ffmpeg command., Insecure Temporary File Handling The plan involves saving uploaded videos to temporary files, which could lead to race conditions or unauthorized access if not handled securely.

